  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agriculture Lahdenpohja</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Jordbruksutv. Lahdenpohja</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet med denna insats &#xe4;r att genom utbildning och r&#xe5;dgivning bidra till att &#xf6;ka och effektivisera jordbruket i V&#xe4;stra Karelen. Det &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att g&#xf6;ra jordbrukare/b&#xf6;nder fr&#xe5;n regionen mer konkurrenskraftiga p&#xe5; marknaden.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to improve and develop farming in the Lahdenpohja region. By education and training in new methods, new skills and knowledge, the efficiency will be raised. This will strengthen the quality of the agriculture and make the farmers more competitive on the Karelian market.</narrative>
  </description>
